 viewJourneys:['Journeys & campaigns','Every Marketing Cloud journey that ran today, step by step.',[['Step bars','Each bar is one step. A red bar is where records were lost.'],['Repeat badge','The same root cause happened before. Click for the history.'],['Live ticker','New failed records as they arrive. Hover to pause.'],['Click a journey','See its flow, root cause, 5-whys, the steps to fix it and the failed records.']]],
