 viewPreflight:['Pre-flight','Checks a journey before it runs and predicts how many records will fail.',[['Countdown','Time left until each journey starts.'],['Verdict','GO = safe to run · CHECK = minor risk · STOP = fix first.'],['Predicted failures','The audience checked against every known failure cause (no email, no consent, expired voucher definition and so on).'],['Exclude at-risk','Hold back the members who would fail.'],['Read-only','It only reads data. Nothing is sent or changed.']]],
